									"children": [
										{
											"_type": "span",
											"_key": "s64",
											"text": "Reading a bill with AI costs us a fraction of a cent, and Tab receives your forwarded bills itself, with no email company in the middle. What actually costs money is the server and the fee on each payment. The prices cover those, not a big margin. We charge once a year so that payment fee doesn't eat a small price.",
